# Voice reference sample.
# A biometric sample of a real, identifiable person does not belong in a
# repository that may become public. Keep it locally, upload it to Kaggle as a
# private dataset for the GPU TTS server, and document its provenance.
# See docs/POSTURE.md and docs/VOICE_SETUP.md.
